2
00:10:12,631 --> 00:10:18,631
First Moon is a horror, thriller film directed by Peter McLeod.

3
00:15:18,947 --> 00:15:24,947
A young waitress is abducted by a religious cult, who are hell-bent on curing her from
a sexually transmitted werewolf virus - or killing her in the process.

4
00:20:25,263 --> 00:20:31,263
Will she escape before the first full moon?

5
00:25:31,578 --> 00:25:37,578
Jessica, played by Lauren Esposito.

6
00:30:37,894 --> 00:30:43,894
Thomas, played by Julian Curtis.

7
00:35:44,210 --> 00:35:50,210
Elyse, played by Shannon Ryan.

8
00:40:50,526 --> 00:40:56,526
Father Torquemada, played by Soren Jensen.

9
00:45:56,842 --> 00:46:02,842
