10
00:51:03,157 --> 00:51:09,157
Monique, played by Yasmin Langlois.

11
00:56:09,473 --> 00:56:15,473
Blue Moon is a 2025 American biographical comedy-drama film directed by Richard Linklater and written by
Robert Kaplow, reportedly inspired by the letters of Elizabeth Weiland to Lorenz Hart.

12
01:01:15,789 --> 01:01:21,789
The film stars Ethan Hawke, Margaret Qualley, Bobby Cannavale and Andrew Scott.

13
01:06:22,105 --> 01:06:28,105
Its plot follows Hart as he reflects on himself on the opening night of
Oklahoma!, a new musical by his former colleague Richard Rodgers.

14
01:11:28,421 --> 01:11:34,421
Blue Moon had its world premiere at the main competition of the 75th Berlin International Film Festival on
February 18, 2025, where it won the Silver Bear for Best Supporting Performance for Scott.

15
01:16:34,736 --> 01:16:40,736
At the 83rd Golden Globe Awards, it was nominated for Best Motion
Picture – Musical or Comedy and Best Actor for Hawke.

16
01:21:41,052 --> 01:21:47,052
At the 98th Academy Awards, Kaplow was nominated for Best
Original Screenplay and Hawke for Best Actor.

17
01:26:47,368 --> 01:26:53,368
It was theatrically released in the United States by Sony Pictures Classics on
October 17, 2025, and received positive reviews from critics.

18
01:31:53,684 --> 01:31:59,684
The tone is dark and intense.
